{"4526990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Happy My Friends", "steam_appid": 4526990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight free-for-all or team up with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every match, you must aim blindly, predicting where other players are hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each round, the play zone shrinks, making encounters increasingly intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last survivor wins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Tactical Gameplay</strong><br>Buy various power-ups during the match and change the tide of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat</strong><br>Deceive other players, cause chaos, or just chat with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong><br>Skins, weapons, hats, and emotes will help you express yourself in the game. Multiple death animations add humor and unexpected moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1a2cde159acda7f256806db7fdf6e3ca.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1a2cde159acda7f256806db7fdf6e3ca.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1a2cde159acda7f256806db7fdf6e3ca.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression and Rewards</strong><br>Battle Pass, missions, achievements, daily bonuses, and a ranked system. Climb the leaderboards and rise above the competition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/fc74c57b753f6ea80eaa0149bdea7540.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/fc74c57b753f6ea80eaa0149bdea7540.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/fc74c57b753f6ea80eaa0149bdea7540.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight free-for-all or team up with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every match, you must aim blindly, predicting where other players are hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each round, the play zone shrinks, making encounters increasingly intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last survivor wins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/a4dbc3bfa2ba73bce49ebf20e5d66ca8.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Tactical Gameplay</strong><br>Buy various power-ups during the match and change the tide of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.poster.avif?t=1784723828\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.webm?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4526990/extras/1aad3ca3b7d8d5d326731ad4c8616b30.mp4?t=1784723828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Chat</strong><br>Deceive other players, cause chaos, or just chat with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong><br>Skins, weapons, hats, and emotes will help you express yourself in the game. Multiple death animations add humor and unexpected moments.<br>